From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TheDBP <TheDBP@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 14:10:48 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] setupwizard-lineage: override Google's SetupWizard on
 lineage-24.0

MindTheGapps ships SetupWizard and GooglePartnerSetup, and on a GApps
build Google's wizard wins: pm resolve-activity for
category.SETUP_WIZARD returns com.google.android.setupwizard with
isDefault=true. Overriding both modules hands setup back to Lineage's
wizard, same one-liner as the 18.1/19.1/20.0 patches; the module names
MindTheGapps uses are unchanged on this branch.

Beyond preference, Google's wizard decides for itself which pages to
show and is closed, so the network page that lets you turn mobile data
on or off during setup never appeared. Lineage's NetworkSetupActivity
skips only when there is neither Wi-Fi nor telephony, or on ethernet,
so it will show.
---
 app/Android.bp | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/app/Android.bp b/app/Android.bp
index 636155a..a606303 100644
--- a/app/Android.bp
+++ b/app/Android.bp
@@ -16,7 +16,7 @@ android_app {
     system_ext_specific: true,
     platform_apis: true,
 
-    overrides: ["Provision"],
+    overrides: ["Provision", "SetupWizard", "GooglePartnerSetup"],
 
     optimize: {
         proguard_flags_files: ["proguard.flags"],
